{'symbol': 'LMT', 'date': '2023-03-07 10:59:00', 'title': 'LOCKHEED MARTIN, KOREA AEROSPACE INDUSTRIES & RED 6 AEROSPACE ANNOUNCE EMERGING TECHNOLOGY PARTNERSHIP', 'text': "FORT WORTH, TEXAS , MARCH 7, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY LOCKHEED MARTIN [NYSE: LMT], KOREA AEROSPACE INDUSTRIES AND RED 6 AEROSPACE ANNOUNCED A NEW PARTNERSHIP THAT WILL DELIVER ADVANCED 21ST CENTURY SECURITY CAPABILITIES ACROSS A SPECTRUM OF TRAINING AND COMBAT AIRCRAFT. THE PARTNERSHIP WILL INITIALLY BRING RED 6'S REVOLUTIONARY AUGMENTED REALITY PLATFORM, THE AIRBORNE TACTICAL AUGMENTED REALITY SYSTEM (ATARS), INTO THE TF-50 AND VARIANTS."}